Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The tsfun_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
117248 bytes, SHA256 8286A8FAE2004F78B468AB65CC18E5818E891140316116593E9F792462C4F40C,
kept as tsfun_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over tsfun_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
